# Unlocking a Myth: Monk (jeuno 103): Lower Jeuno's Zalsuhm (no script; default 10085), the template UnlockingAMyth for
# xi.job.MNK (2). A level 75 MNK with the BurningFists (its Vigil weapon, Main slot) at 250 weapon skill points.
# Available: a trade: no trade handler; not wearing it: 10085; worn: 10086 (2), finished 0: nothing; 10086 again,
# finished 2: begun. Accepted: the cutscene 10087. (The worn weapon cannot be traded: #trade trades it unworn.) The
# other nineteen jobs' quests are silent (each check reads the main job).
lists LowerJeuno/Zalsuhm/onTrigger LowerJeuno/Zalsuhm/onTrade LowerJeuno/onEventFinish/10086
char zone=LowerJeuno pos=-31.5,5.9,-117.5 job=MNK lvl=75
item BurningFists wsp=250
login
trade Zalsuhm BurningFists x1           # available: no trade handler; nothing
trigger Zalsuhm                         # not wearing the weapon: 10085
finish
equip BurningFists Main                 # the Main slot
trigger Zalsuhm                         # wearing it: 10086 (2)
finish option=0                         # neither 53 nor 2: nothing
trigger Zalsuhm                         # 10086 (2)
finish option=2                         # begun
trigger Zalsuhm                         # accepted: the cutscene 10087
finish
